'''Leather armor''' is a type of [[armor]] made from [[leather]]. It is the weakest armor, right below [[Copper Armor|copper]].

== List of items ==
* {{ItemLink|Leather Cap}}
* {{ItemLink|Leather Tunic}}
* {{ItemLink|Leather Pants}}
* {{ItemLink|Leather Boots}}

