=== Mob loot ===
In [[Normal]] and [[Hard]] difficulties, [[zombie]]s, [[husk]]s, [[zombie villager]]s, [[skeleton]]s, [[stray]]s, [[bogged]], and [[piglin]]s have a chance to spawn with armor, with a 23.60% chance of it being leather armor. If killed by a [[player]], there is an 8.5% chance of dropping the armor. The dropped armor has a random [[durability]] and retains any enchantments it has.

=== Trading ===
{{main|Trading}}
Leather armor can be bought from [[leatherworker]]s.
{{trade sources|Leather Cap|Leather Tunic|Leather Pants|Leather Boots}}

=== Fishing ===
[[Leather boots]], often badly damaged, can be obtained as a junk item from fishing.

== Usage ==
{{main|Armor#Usage}}
Wearing leather armor reduces damage taken from [[Armor#Damage types|most damage types]] and provides immunity to [[freezing]].

